== 8. the main guard — measured fail-open (B2) ==
Fixture: scripts/no-vendor.mjs + test/bin/{claude,codex} + a package.json whose test:suite exits 1.
  from "<scratch>/space test/"  -> node scripts/no-vendor.mjs -> EXIT 0, nothing ran (no preflight, no self-test,
